# Session 9 ruling: warehouse data leaves git (a hosted Postgres becomes the live store).
# Tables are regenerated by the connectors; see warehouse/output/README.md. Allowlist: the
# public news index, and files under 1 MB that a doc links to (the digests link news_stories).
